# Lore Engine - Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and add your actual API keys

# ============================================================================
# GEMINI API KEYS
# ============================================================================

# Get your free Gemini API key from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey

# OR use numbered keys for parallel processing (recommended for speed):
GEMINI_API_KEY_1=your_first_api_key_here
# GEMINI_API_KEY_2=your_second_api_key_here
# GEMINI_API_KEY_3=your_third_api_key_here

# Pro tip: More API keys = faster processing!
# Each additional key adds another parallel worker

# ============================================================================
# NOTES
# ============================================================================
# 
# - The engine uses numbered keys (GEMINI_API_KEY_1, GEMINI_API_KEY_2, etc.) 
#   in round-robin fashion for parallel processing
# - All API keys from Google AI Studio are free tier with generous limits
# - Keep this file secure and never commit it to version control
